          "changelog": "Daily check-in now includes a personal calendar and history, with pages that follow the gateway's native UI.\n\n## Requirements\n\nRequires TokenRouter 0.6.1 or later and plugin API v1. This release uses native configuration-field descriptions. Keep plugin v1.0.0 on an unmodified TokenRouter v0.6.0 installation until upgrading the gateway.\n\nFor local testing before the gateway release, build the gateway from current `main` and enable \"Ignore version check\" when installing. Use \"Force overwrite installation\" to replace an existing build.\n\nExisting check-in records remain in place. Ordinary reinstall and code rollback preserve business data; rollback does not undo wallet transactions.\n\n## New features\n\n- Browse personal check-in history by month, inspect calendar dates, and view completed-day and reward totals.\n- Filter administrator records by month, user ID, and reward status. Open the host's configuration and payout-limit forms from the reward-settings view.\n- Pause new check-ins while keeping history available and allowing today's pending rewards to be retried.\n\n## Improvements and fixes\n\n- Reuse native controls, tables, pagination, and theme colors. Simplify page copy and typography, remove the duplicate pagination divider, and replace the redundant payout-limit card with a compact settings link.\n- Show recorded rewards after configuration changes and preserve values with more than two decimal places. Completed zero rewards are labeled as recorded attendance.\n- Refresh at the next midnight in the site timezone, including daylight-saving changes. Preserve confirmed check-in completion if the displayed balance fails to refresh, with a separate balance refresh action.\n- Validate new reward amounts before recording a claim. Pending retries keep the original amount and wallet idempotency key.\n- Query history across bounded storage pages, with exact decimal totals and an explicit error above 50,000 records rather than partial results.\n\n## Downloads\n\nArchives are provided for Linux amd64/arm64, macOS amd64/arm64, and Windows amd64. `plugin.json` and `checksums.txt` are included with the release assets. Local builds use Go plugin SDK v0.2.0 and write packages to `release/\u003cversion\u003e/`.\n\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003e中文翻译\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n每日签到新增个人日历和可筛选的历史记录，页面沿用网关原生 UI。\n\n## 运行要求\n\n需要 TokenRouter 0.6.1 或更高版本，以及插件 API v1。本版使用网关原生配置字段说明。尚未修改的 TokenRouter v0.6.0 安装应继续使用插件 v1.0.0，待网关升级后再更新。\n\n网关正式发布前，如需本地测试，可从当前 `main` 构建网关，安装时开启“忽略版本检查”。替换已有构建时，再开启“强制覆盖安装”。\n\n已有签到记录会保留。普通重装和代码回滚保留业务数据；回滚不会撤销钱包交易。\n\n## 新功能\n\n- 按月份查看个人签到历史、检查日历日期，并查看已完成签到天数和奖励总额。\n- 管理员可按月份、用户 ID 和发放状态筛选记录，并从奖励设置页打开网关的配置和发放上限表单。\n- 支持暂停新签到，同时保留历史查询，并允许重试当天待确认的奖励。\n\n## 改进与修复\n\n- 复用原生控件、表格、分页和主题色。精简页面文案与字号层级，移除重复的分页分隔线，将冗余的发放上限说明卡改为简洁入口。\n- 配置修改后仍显示记录中的实际奖励，超过两位小数的金额保留完整精度。零奖励的已完成记录标为仅记录签到。\n- 按站点时区的下一个午夜刷新，处理夏令时变化。页面余额刷新失败时保留签到成功状态，并提供独立的余额刷新操作。\n- 创建签到记录前校验新奖励金额。待确认记录重试时保留原金额和钱包幂等键。\n- 分页扫描历史记录并精确汇总金额，超过 50,000 条时明确报错，不返回不完整结果。\n\n## 下载\n\n提供 Linux amd64/arm64、macOS amd64/arm64 和 Windows amd64 安装包；发布附件同时包含 `plugin.json` 和 `ch",
